  "notes": "The host moved from api.together.xyz to api.together.ai. GET /v1/models answers a bare array, so models are declared. service_tier, store, metadata and prediction are accepted but ignored, and logit_bias is unsupported on most models; all are refused. Only max_tokens is documented. Rerank, documented at https://docs.together.ai/reference/rerank-1, serves dedicated endpoints and refuses truncation, which it has no control for. Files and batches evidence records the fields and endpoints used by the M9.2 adapter: Files upload at /v1/files/upload using file, file_name, purpose=batch-api and file_type=jsonl. Batch creation uses endpoint, input_file_id and optional completion_window; responses wrap the job. Job status is VALIDATING, IN_PROGRESS, COMPLETED, FAILED, EXPIRED or CANCELLED and timestamps are RFC3339.",
